    t\u01B0\u1EDBng \u1EDF h\xE0ng ch\u1EDD, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m m\u1ED9t \xF4 tr\u1ED1ng
    h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7.\n\n<color=#EABF62><b>03  PH\xC2N VAI</b></color>\nTank tuy\u1EBFn
    tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, K\u1EF5 S\u0129 \xE1p s\xE1t, X\u1EA1 Th\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EE9ng
    ph\xEDa sau.\n\n<color=#EABF62><b>04  N\xC2NG SAO</b></color>\nBa t\u01B0\u1EDBng
    c\xF9ng lo\u1EA1i, c\xF9ng sao s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t v\xE0 m\u1EA1nh
    h\u01A1n."
